    }), "\n", _jsx(_components.p, {
      children: "Data minimization and retention policies reduce compliance risk by limiting what data is collected and how long it's stored. Implement automated retention policies that delete raw event data after business requirements are satisfied (often 90-365 days). Aggregate data for long-term analytics while discarding individual event details. When users exercise deletion rights under GDPR or CCPA, implement cascading deletion that removes data from all systems including backups and data warehouses. This requires tracking data lineage through the entire pipeline."
